{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39471904",
      "title": "Nested Animations & Variants",
      "sourceHash": "766108d5f067c3a4d672748c9e0096bdac7f2871869c9d34cc34268fd1037ec7",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.81,
          "end": 2.61,
          "en": "Variants cannot just be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.61,
          "end": 6.87,
          "en": "for defining and reusing animation states,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.87,
          "end": 11.87,
          "en": "but instead they can also be used to trigger animations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.06,
          "end": 14.52,
          "en": "deep inside of a component tree",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.52,
          "end": 18.09,
          "en": "by just setting an animation to a certain variant",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.09,
          "end": 20.7,
          "en": "on an ancestor component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.7,
          "end": 24.15,
          "en": "And this of course, probably sounds pretty abstract,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.15,
          "end": 25.713,
          "en": "so let me show you what I mean.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.73,
          "end": 30,
          "en": "Keep in mind that here, we're in the modal component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30,
          "end": 33.42,
          "en": "and this modal component, this dialog here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.42,
          "end": 34.95,
          "en": "will in the end wrap",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.95,
          "end": 38.43,
          "en": "whatever is passed between the opening and closing tags",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.43,
          "end": 40.113,
          "en": "of this modal component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.1,
          "end": 44.37,
          "en": "And that therefore, here in my case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.37,
          "end": 46.95,
          "en": "will be this New Challenge component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.95,
          "end": 49.593,
          "en": "to be precise here, this form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.06,
          "end": 53.46,
          "en": "because this form is passed as a child",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.46,
          "end": 56.853,
          "en": "between the modal opening and closing tag here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.96,
          "end": 59.76,
          "en": "Now the idea behind variants",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.76,
          "end": 63.84,
          "en": "is that we can now set a certain animation state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.84,
          "end": 67.89,
          "en": "to a variant in such a wrapper or a parent component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.89,
          "end": 70.35,
          "en": "like this modal component here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.35,
          "end": 73.05,
          "en": "and inside of the wrapped or child component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.05,
          "end": 74.82,
          "en": "like this form here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.82,
          "end": 77.25,
          "en": "and all the elements we're using in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.25,
          "end": 79.74,
          "en": "We can now define the same variants,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 79.74,
          "end": 83.523,
          "en": "so using the same names, hidden and visible, in my case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.51,
          "end": 88.26,
          "en": "but we don't have to set them there to activate them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.26,
          "end": 90.48,
          "en": "Instead, if they activate in the parent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90.48,
          "end": 94.08,
          "en": "or wrapping component in this modal component here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 94.08,
          "end": 97.743,
          "en": "they will automatically be activated in the child component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 98.7,
          "end": 102.21000000000001,
          "en": "And this can be very useful because here in this modal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 102.21000000000001,
          "end": 104.55,
          "en": "we could, for example, animate the appearance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 104.55,
          "end": 106.443,
          "en": "of those images here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 107.49000000000001,
          "end": 109.59,
          "en": "And of course, I want to animate those",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 109.59,
          "end": 111.3,
          "en": "as this modal is opened,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 111.3,
          "end": 113.913,
          "en": "as this component here is loaded therefore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 114.93,
          "end": 117.93,
          "en": "Now thanks to this variants feature,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 117.93,
          "end": 120.33,
          "en": "we can go to this unordered list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 120.33,
          "end": 123.93299999999999,
          "en": "and there to these list items which are these images,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 124.92,
          "end": 129.06,
          "en": "and we can change this list item here to a motion list item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 129.06,
          "end": 132.363,
          "en": "so that we can animate it with help of variants.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 133.86,
          "end": 138.81,
          "en": "To do that, of course, we first must import motion",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 138.81,
          "end": 141.243,
          "en": "from framer-motion as always,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 143.25,
          "end": 145.8,
          "en": "and then go down to that list item again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 145.8,
          "end": 148.293,
          "en": "and replace it with motion.li.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 149.37,
          "end": 150.203,
          "en": "But other than that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 150.203,
          "end": 152.823,
          "en": "it's of course still a regular list item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 154.2,
          "end": 157.77,
          "en": "And now to play some animation when this appears,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 157.77,
          "end": 161.57999999999998,
          "en": "we don't have to add animate and initial,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 161.57999999999998,
          "end": 165.54,
          "en": "instead we just have to define a hidden and visible variant",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 165.54,
          "end": 168.36,
          "en": "with the variants prop here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 168.36,
          "end": 171.96,
          "en": "because those variants will then automatically be activated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 171.96,
          "end": 175.95,
          "en": "by the parent wrapping component, this modal component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 175.95,
          "end": 179.01,
          "en": "because there we are setting this hidden variant",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 179.01,
          "end": 181.14,
          "en": "as a value for the initial state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 181.14,
          "end": 185.343,
          "en": "and divisible variant as a value for the animate state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 186.18,
          "end": 188.94,
          "en": "And as mentioned, this information,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 188.94,
          "end": 191.94,
          "en": "which variant should be active at which point of time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 191.94,
          "end": 195.03,
          "en": "will be passed down by a Framer Motion",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 195.03,
          "end": 197.55,
          "en": "to any wrapped or child components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 197.55,
          "end": 200.28,
          "en": "so also to this list item here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 200.28,
          "end": 203.43,
          "en": "and therefore here, we just have to define a hidden",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 203.43,
          "end": 205.05,
          "en": "and a visible variant",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 205.05,
          "end": 208.17000000000002,
          "en": "and those variants will be activated automatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 208.17000000000002,
          "end": 210.693,
          "en": "when they activate on the parent component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 212.31,
          "end": 213.9,
          "en": "And here on those images,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 213.9,
          "end": 218.46,
          "en": "I want my images to be transparent initially",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 218.46,
          "end": 220.35,
          "en": "and maybe be a bit smaller",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 220.35,
          "end": 224.583,
          "en": "so that they basically grow in size as they become visible,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 225.84,
          "end": 227.82,
          "en": "and therefore, in the visible state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 227.82,
          "end": 231.78300000000002,
          "en": "I want to have an opacity of 1 and a scale of 1, let's say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 233.28,
          "end": 236.01,
          "en": "Now in addition, I'll also add the transition prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 236.01,
          "end": 237.75,
          "en": "which we of course can also do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 237.75,
          "end": 240.123,
          "en": "on such a child animation element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 241.14,
          "end": 243.12,
          "en": "and here I'll make sure that we use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 243.12,
          "end": 245.613,
          "en": "this spring animation type.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 247.35,
          "end": 249.42,
          "en": "Now with that, if we save that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 249.42,
          "end": 253.623,
          "en": "you'll see that if I open this, those images do bounce in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 255.03,
          "end": 258,
          "en": "You'll also note, though, that as I close this modal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 258,
          "end": 260.61,
          "en": "we have a pretty strange effect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 260.61,
          "end": 264.33299999999997,
          "en": "It takes some time for the backdrop to disappear.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 265.53,
          "end": 269.01,
          "en": "And we got this behavior here because in my modal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 269.01,
          "end": 273.3,
          "en": "I'm setting this exit prop here to the hidden state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 273.3,
          "end": 274.593,
          "en": "to the hidden variant.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 276.36,
          "end": 278.88,
          "en": "Therefore, this will also be activated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 278.88,
          "end": 280.26,
          "en": "on the child components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 280.26,
          "end": 281.82,
          "en": "and therefore those images",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 281.82,
          "end": 286.82,
          "en": "will actually be animated out there in this child component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 286.86,
          "end": 289.92,
          "en": "And we don't really see this here as I close this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 289.92,
          "end": 291.72,
          "en": "though you can see it briefly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 291.72,
          "end": 293.64,
          "en": "If you take a close look at those images,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 293.64,
          "end": 296.74,
          "en": "you might see them shrink right before the modal disappears",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 297.93,
          "end": 300.18,
          "en": "and Framer Motion actually waits",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 300.18,
          "end": 302.64,
          "en": "for that image animation to finish",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 302.64,
          "end": 305.01,
          "en": "before it then finally removes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 305.01,
          "end": 306.57,
          "en": "this element from the DOM",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 306.57,
          "end": 309.66,
          "en": "and also this backdrop from the DOM.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 309.66,
          "end": 312.663,
          "en": "And that's of course not the behavior I want here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 314.37,
          "end": 318.09,
          "en": "Now, one way to fix or change this behavior",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 318.09,
          "end": 320.22,
          "en": "is to go to this child component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 320.22,
          "end": 322.02,
          "en": "this list item component here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 322.02,
          "end": 327.02,
          "en": "and to there, set the exit prop and set it to visible here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 329.79,
          "end": 333.21,
          "en": "So with that, I'm overriding the variant",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 333.21,
          "end": 337.11,
          "en": "that should be activated when we enter this exit state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 337.11,
          "end": 338.28,
          "en": "on this list item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 338.28,
          "end": 340.38,
          "en": "and I'm setting it to the visible variant",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 340.38,
          "end": 341.82,
          "en": "just for this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 341.82,
          "end": 343.383,
          "en": "not for any other component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 345,
          "end": 347.34000000000003,
          "en": "So for the parent component for this modal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 347.34000000000003,
          "end": 350.7,
          "en": "the exit state will still be set to the hidden variant",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 350.7,
          "end": 354.09000000000003,
          "en": "but for this child component, this nested list item here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 354.09000000000003,
          "end": 356.82,
          "en": "the exit state will be set to the visible variant,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 356.82,
          "end": 359.25,
          "en": "and therefore no animation will be played here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 359.25,
          "end": 362.043,
          "en": "because we already are in this visible state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 363.33,
          "end": 367.38,
          "en": "So now with this exit prop set to visible here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 367.38,
          "end": 369.99,
          "en": "you will see that as you close this modal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 369.99,
          "end": 372.78,
          "en": "indeed now the backdrop does disappear",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 372.78,
          "end": 374.793,
          "en": "right after the modal closes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 375.78,
          "end": 378.03,
          "en": "But you also will notice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 378.03,
          "end": 381.27,
          "en": "that now the entry animation of these images is gone.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 381.27,
          "end": 385.023,
          "en": "If I open the modal, those images are not animated anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 385.92,
          "end": 387.63,
          "en": "And we got this behavior",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 387.63,
          "end": 389.7,
          "en": "because at least at the point of time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 389.7,
          "end": 391.65,
          "en": "where I'm recording this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 391.65,
          "end": 394.08,
          "en": "if you set one of those animation props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 394.08,
          "end": 398.19,
          "en": "like initial, animate, or exit on some child components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 398.19,
          "end": 401.97,
          "en": "when using that variants feature to activate animations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 401.97,
          "end": 403.77,
          "en": "as we're doing it here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 403.77,
          "end": 407.463,
          "en": "you must not use one of your variant names here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 408.45,
          "end": 411.33,
          "en": "Instead, you should copy the value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 411.33,
          "end": 413.79,
          "en": "that's assigned to a certain variant,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 413.79,
          "end": 417.783,
          "en": "the visible variant in this case, and use stat in stat.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 419.55,
          "end": 422.22,
          "en": "This might be fixed and changed in the future",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 422.22,
          "end": 424.26,
          "en": "but at the point of time I'm recording this,",
          "zh": ""
